  - `build()` - Initializes with estimated duration (40 minutes for 2000m at 120 sec/100m)
- Key difference from running/cycling: Swimming uses PACE PER 100M (seconds)
  - Duration calculation: `(distanceMeters / 100) * pacePer100Seconds`
  - Example: 2000 meters at 120 seconds per 100m = 20 segments × 120 seconds = 2400 seconds = 40 minutes
