### Phase 2.1 IntensityDistribution Domain Model (Completed)
- Model location: `/lib/features/nutrition_plan/domain/intensity_distribution.dart`
- Test location: `/test/features/nutrition_plan/domain/intensity_distribution_test.dart`
- Key features:
  - Three zones: Conversational (Z1-Z2), Tempo (Z3-Z4), All-Out (Z5+)
  - Constructor validation: All percentages must sum to 100 and be 0-100
  - Default factory: `defaultDistribution()` creates 70/20/10 split
  - Proportional adjustment: `adjustProportionally()` redistributes delta across other zones
  - JSON serialization: Full `toJson()` and `fromJson()` support
  - Equality and hashCode implementation
  - copyWith for immutable updates
- Proportional adjustment algorithm:
  1. Calculate delta = newValue - oldValue
  2. Distribute delta proportionally across remaining zones based on their current values
  3. Clamp all values to 0-100 range
  4. Normalize to ensure sum = 100 (largest zone absorbs any rounding differences)
- Edge cases handled:
  - Zero values in zones (distributes to non-zero zones)
  - Single zone with 100% (normalization prevents invalid states)
  - Rapid successive adjustments (maintains sum = 100)
  - Clamping values above 100 or below 0
- Test coverage: 31 tests (100% pass rate)
  - Constructor validation
  - Default factory
  - copyWith behavior
  - Proportional adjustment (8 scenarios)
  - JSON serialization round-trips
  - Equality and toString

